# Local Rally room state.
# Four things in .rally/ are canonical (committed) and survive clone/machine
# with no external service:
#   - `.rally/ledger.jsonl` (R1) and/or `.rally/log/**` (R5): the append-only
#     durable record of every fact. R5 supersedes the monolith with
#     per-engagement segments; R1's `.rally/ledger.jsonl` remains a valid
#     input path during migration.
#   - `.rally/archive/**` (R7): rotated old segments, still replayable.
#   - `.rally/manifest.json` (R4): self-describing pointers to docs + ledger
#     so any agent landing in the repo finds the rally point.
#   - `.rally/RETROSPECTIVE.md` (R6): human-readable digest grouped by
#     engagement. Derived view (regenerate via `rally retrospective`; do
#     not hand-edit) but committed so a fresh clone sees the history.
# Everything else under .rally/ is a derived cache (facts.db, room.db,
# cursors.json, .reconcile-cache.json, tmp files) that `rally` rebuilds from
# the ledger on first open. The reconcile sidecar (.reconcile-cache.json) is a
# disposable fingerprint cache for the O(1) reconcile fast path; a
# missing/corrupt sidecar just forces a full authoritative scan + rebuild.
.rally/*
!.rally/ledger.jsonl
!.rally/manifest.json
!.rally/RETROSPECTIVE.md
!.rally/log/
.rally/log/index.json
!.rally/archive/
.rally/log/*.tmp-*
.rally/archive/*.tmp-*
.rally2/

# build-loop's own runtime + planning artifacts. build-loop is one optional
# tool that may be used to *build* agent-rally-point on Claude hosts; its
# files belong to itself, not to this repo. Ignore the whole directory.
.build-loop/

# uv lockfile — library-style project; downstream pipx installs resolve own deps.
uv.lock
# Exception: vendored watcher is an app-style daemon + port reference — ship its lock for reproducible installs.
!tools/agent-rally-watcher/uv.lock
.claude/worktrees/

# Optional tool runtime dirs (per-tool data lives under .<toolname>/, not in-repo).
.bookmark/
.navgator/
.claude/*
!.claude/settings.json
.claude/settings.local.json
.ibr/

# cockpitd runtime SQLite (created by `cockpitd serve` default COCKPIT_DB)
cockpitd.db
cockpitd.db-shm
cockpitd.db-wal

# Runtime coordination state + backups + local bundles (never commit; see 2026-07-02 takeover)
.rally.bak-*/
archive/bundles/
agent-rally-point.worktrees/
RALLY-VERSION-MISMATCH-ASSESSMENT-*.md
